  "bio": "Of Khurasani origin, raised in Baghdad and settled in Asqalan on the Syrian coast, where he died. A devout man praised by Abu Hatim, he heard Shu'bah in Basra and is al-Bukhari's shaykh in the second chain of hadith 15. Muslim and Ibn Majah did not use him.",
